---
description: React talks only to the Express API — no providers, no MongoDB
globs: client/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend boundaries

Use `client/src/services` API modules (`api.auth`, `api.chat`, …). Do not scatter `fetch`/`axios` in components.

Never import AI vendor SDKs, Mongoose, or MongoDB drivers.
Never read provider credentials.
Models and providers come from backend endpoints such as `GET /api/models`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
await fetch('/api/conversations');

// ✅ GOOD
await api.conversations.list();
```
